      "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></msub><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo></math>tert-butyl ethyl ether; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></msub><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo></math>iso-butyl ethyl ether</p>",
